                "userDescription": "Stop a running Snakemake pipeline, after confirmation.",
                "modelDescription": "Stop a running Snakemake pipeline run: Snakemake cancels its running jobs (including Workbench jobs) and exits. The user confirms first.",
                "tags": [
                    "positron-assistant",
